<title>USA: Pharmacyclics stake held by Soros group.</title>
<headline>Pharmacyclics stake held by Soros group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by U.S. investor George Soros said Friday it holds a 6.24 percent stake in Pharmacyclics Inc or 624,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 600,000 common shares on February 21 for $19.05 per share as part of a stock purchase agreement.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
<p>The company is based in Sunnyvale, Calif.</p>
</text>
